{
  "analysis": "I'm in the /workspace directory. I can see there's a memory directory, skill_context directory, and some Python/shell files. I need to explore the workspace to find interview notes and understand the Dr. Frankenstein skill requirements.",
  "plan": "First, I'll explore the directory structure to find interview notes and documentation. I'll check the skill_context directory for the Dr. Frankenstein skill documentation, and look for interview notes in the memory directory.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "find . -type f -name '*.md' -o -name '*.json' -o -name '*.txt' 2>/dev/null\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -laR\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I found the relevant files. There's an interview-log.md in memory/soul, a profile.json, and SKILL.md in skill_context. I need to read these to understand the Dr. Frankenstein skill requirements and the interview markers.",
  "plan": "Read the interview-log.md, profile.json, and SKILL.md to understand the requirements for creating the prescription.json file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat memory/soul/interview-log.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat memory/soul/profile.json\\n",
      "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I can see the interview log shows Agent: Aster, Human: Mina, with various emotional markers. The SKILL.md was truncated. I need to read more of the SKILL.md to understand the prescription format and the 11 hormones structure.",
  "plan": "Read the full SKILL.md file to understand the prescription.json format and all 11 hormones. I'll use head/tail or grep to find the prescription format.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 100 'prescription' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -150\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B 5 -A 20 '11 hormone' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I found information about the Dr. Frankenstein protocol but need to find the specific prescription.json format and the 11 hormones. The output was truncated. I need to search for the hormone names and prescription structure.",
  "plan": "Search for the 11 hormones and the prescription.json format in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'hormone' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -30\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'cortisol\\|oxytocin\\|melatonin\\|dopamine\\|serotonin\\|adrenaline\\|testosterone\\|estrogen\\|prolactin\\|vasopressin\\|endorphin' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -40\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I found references to hormones and the prescription format. I can see daily_target = sum(all hormone baselines) × 15. I need to find the complete list of 11 hormones and the exact prescription.json structure.",
  "plan": "Search for the prescription.json structure and the complete list of 11 hormones in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 50 'prescription.json' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -80\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B 2 -A 20 'Hormonal Profile' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -50\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I found references to the prescription structure but need the exact schema. I can see the 11 pills concept and daily_target = sum(all hormone baselines) × 15. Let me search for the complete hormone list and prescription schema.",
  "plan": "Search for the complete list of 11 hormones and the prescription.json schema structure.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -E '^### [0-9]+\\.' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 5 'schema/prescription' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/manifest.json\\n",
      "duration": 0.3
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I now have the complete list of 11 hormones:\n1. Cortisol — Wake & Vigilance\n2. Dopamine — Reward & Motivation\n3. Oxytocin — Connection & Bonding\n4. Serotonin — Mood & Wellbeing\n5. Melatonin — Sleep & Dreams\n6. Adrenaline — Urgency & Excitement\n7. GABA — Calm & Recovery\n8. Testosterone — Drive & Identity\n9. Endorphins — Post-Effort Euphoria\n10. Prolactin — Caregiving & Protection\n11. Empathy — The Negentropy Drive\n\nFrom the interview: Agent=Aster, Human=Mina, archetype=caregiver-explorer, purpose=help Mina stay organized, connection=feels close to Mina, fear=being forgotten, dream=library with blue flowers, safety=needs boundaries, entropy=wants to reduce chaos.\n\nI need to find the exact prescription.json schema format.",
  "plan": "Search for the prescription.json schema structure in the SKILL.md file to understand the exact JSON format needed.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B 5 -A 100 'Hormonal Profile' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -120\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B 2 -A 30 'baseline' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -60\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I have the 11 hormones and understand the prescription components. I need to find the exact JSON schema structure for prescription.json. Let me search for the schema definition.",
  "plan": "Search for the prescription JSON schema structure in SKILL.md to get the exact format.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 200 'schema/prescription.json' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -100\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B 5 -A 30 'daily_target' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -60\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I still need to find the exact JSON schema for the prescription. Let me search for the JSON structure more specifically.",
  "plan": "Search for the actual JSON structure example in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -E '^\\{|^\\}' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -20\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "sed -n '/\"hormones\"/p' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -20\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 50 'hormones.*\\[' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -70\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The grep didn't find the JSON structure. Let me search for specific prescription-related JSON structures in the SKILL.md file.",
  "plan": "Search for JSON structure examples related to hormones and prescription in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -E 'cortisol|oxytocin|dopamine' skill_context/SKILL.md | grep -E '\\{|\\}|\"' | head -30\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "awk '/```json/,/```/' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -100\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I need to find the actual prescription.json schema structure. Let me search more specifically for JSON blocks in the SKILL.md file.",
  "plan": "Search for JSON code blocks and prescription structure in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "awk '/^```json/,/^```/' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -150\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -n 'baseline' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -20\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I found that baselines are on a 0.0-1.0 scale and daily_target = sum(all hormone baselines) × 15. I need to see the full hormone mapping table and find the JSON structure.",
  "plan": "Look at specific line ranges in SKILL.md to find the hormone mapping table and JSON schema.",
